## Key Features

### Viewport Culling Test
- **How it works**: ListView tracks visible range and updates model
- **Buffer**: Loads 10 items ahead/behind visible area
- **Toggle**: Can disable to see baseline performance

### Frame Budget Test
- **How it works**: Limits uploads per 16ms frame
- **Configurable**: Slider from 1-50 uploads/frame
- **Visual Feedback**: Current frame completions bar

### Thumb Resolution Test ⭐
- **Range**: 128px to 512px (step: 64px)
- **Default**: 256px (marked with star and visual indicator)
- **Purpose**: Tests impact of aggressive downscaling on scroll performance
- **Dynamic**: Delegates resize in real-time

