## Special Feature: Thumb Resolution Slider

As requested, ScrollBench includes a **thumb resolution slider** (128-512px) with:
- ⭐ **Default marker at 256px** (visual star + highlighted text)
- **Aggressive downscaling simulation** (delegates resize in real-time)
- **Performance impact testing** (see how thumb size affects viewport culling)

This mirrors the main app's thumb resolution control and lets you test the interaction between:
- Viewport culling (how many items loaded)
- Frame budget (how many uploads per frame)
- Thumb size (how much data per upload)

All three factors combine to determine final UI responsiveness!

